WEBVTT

00:45:26.329 --> 00:45:34.663
the decision to end my first marriage is
to abandon the woman I am now who says,

00:45:34.663 --> 00:45:37.496
oh my gosh, I was too young to get married
and he was great and everything,

00:45:37.496 --> 00:45:38.996
but it's a good thing we broke up

00:45:38.996 --> 00:45:41.621
because now we're both married to other
people and we're happy, you know,

00:45:41.746 --> 00:45:47.954
so leave that person at the door and
and start writing your way into

00:45:47.954 --> 00:45:52.038
the person who was in love
with this man. Truly.

00:45:52.996 --> 00:45:56.621
And who also felt like she
could not stay with him,

00:45:56.621 --> 00:46:02.204
who had to break his heart and her own
in order to live the life that she,